  "scope": "Mithril dwelling eligibility and prices use audited initial source MA:L, including zero and TUM overrides; native extensions adapt their one-based tiers. Six pointer-driven purchases preserve stocks and deduct nine mithril through native save/reload. Source149/170/171, external MA:L mutations and exact mill scheduling remain unadmitted.",
